const FORKED_SUBAGENT_NESTING_NOTICE = "Do not call the `subagent` tool. You are currently running inside a forked subagent, and this is the maximum allowed subagent nesting level. Further subagent calls will return an error. Answer the task directly using the conversation history and the other tools available to you.";
